## Required Reading

The project's rules live in `docs/`, written for people, and apply to agents unchanged.
Read each one before the work it covers:

- [`docs/CONTRIBUTING.md`](docs/CONTRIBUTING.md): before creating a branch, committing,
  or opening a pull request
- [`docs/code-style.md`](docs/code-style.md): before writing or changing code
- [`docs/development.md`](docs/development.md): before changing a manifest, adding a
  crate, or touching CI
- [`docs/releasing.md`](docs/releasing.md): before bumping a version or tagging a release

## Quick Reference

**Before committing, always run:**

```bash
cargo fmt --all                                           # Format code
cargo clippy --all --all-features --tests -- -D warnings  # Lint (must pass)
cargo test                                                # Run tests
```

All three commands must pass without errors before code is considered ready.
